# Accurova Graphene — environment variables
#
# Phase 1 (the editor) is entirely client-side and needs NO environment
# variables or API keys. Editing, saving and exporting never call a server.
#
# Phase 3 will add an optional server-side AI layer. Its keys must live here
# (server-side only), never in browser code. Reserved names:
#
# AI_PROVIDER=openai
# OPENAI_API_KEY=
# OPENAI_TEXT_MODEL=
# OPENAI_IMAGE_MODEL=
# GRAPHENE_AI_ENABLED=false
